{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 與 (RED) 自 2006 年起合作，為對抗 HIV/AIDS 籌款，並將於曼哈頓 SoHo 店舉行特別活動，紀念 (RED) 二十週年及回顧已取得的進展。活動定於 12 月 1 日東部時間中午 12 時舉行；Apple 亦預計在下週前推出四款全新 (PRODUCT)RED 產品。</p>\n<h2>SoHo 店二十週年對談</h2>\n<p>Apple 高級總監 Alisha Johnson Wilder 將主持對談，嘉賓包括 (RED) 董事總經理 Kate Charles、(RED) 顧問委員會成員 Iman，以及 Apple 市場營銷主管 Greg Joswiak。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Apple-Store-Front.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/product-red/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.814743+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:22:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:52.468676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:27.562234+00:00","content_hash":"ab3b3c35ff2b7001a5f6d366c436a06284cbf1491e77e4c73674f009ba7aec87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}